title: The Land Question
card-image: img/cards/agricultural_policy.svg?v=2
subtitle: Land committees now, or wait for the Constituent Assembly.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: coalition_affairs
view-if: agricultural_policy_timer <= 0 and land_decree = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; agricultural_policy_timer = 3

The peasants want the landlords' land, and some of them are taking it. The SR minister Chernov wants to regulate the transfers through the land committees; the Kadets say that nothing should be done until the Assembly meets. (Land pressure: [+ land_pressure : level +].)

- @committees: Back the land committees' temporary transfers now.
- @wait: Wait for the Constituent Assembly.
- @reform: Move state and Church lands to the committees at once.
- @easy_discard

@committees

How should the party go about it? Cautiously, with compromises, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. In full, it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can carry it out and break its opponents.

- @committees_slow: Go about it cautiously, with compromises.
- @committees_decree: Carry it out in full.
- @committees_force: Carry it out in full, and break any opposition by force.

@committees_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: -10, rel_kad: -6, rel_ally: 3, right_threat: 3});
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 3, soldiers: 2});
Q.land_committees = (Q.land_committees || 0) + 1;
}, "Back the land committees' temporary transfers now");
!}

The land committees regulate the transfers of land until the Assembly meets. Landowners are alarmed, and so are their friends in the officer corps. (It was done cautiously, with compromises.)



@committees_decree
subtitle: All that it says. Its opponents will answer.
on-arrival: {!

