RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: -10, rel_kad: -6, rel_ally: 3, right_threat: 3});
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 3, soldiers: 2});
Q.land_committees = (Q.land_committees || 0) + 1;
}, "Back the land committees' temporary transfers now");
!}

The land committees regulate the transfers of land until the Assembly meets. Landowners are alarmed, and so are their friends in the officer corps.



@committees_force
view-if: bol_regime = 0
choose-if: strength >= 18
subtitle: Your chance of breaking each camp it angers: Kadets [+ odds_kad +]%, generals [+ odds_gen +]%. Any camp under 45% is too strong for you, and is left alone.
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the force and the allies to break the opposition.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'force', () => {
RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: -10, rel_kad: -6, rel_ally: 3, right_threat: 3});
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 3, soldiers: 2});
Q.land_committees = (Q.land_committees || 0) + 1;
}, "Back the land committees' temporary transfers now");
!}

The land committees regulate the transfers of land until the Assembly meets. Landowners are alarmed, and so are their friends in the officer corps. [+ law_text +]

@wait
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: 3, rel_kad: 3, right_threat: -1});
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: -2, middle: 1});
!}

The land question will be settled by the Constituent Assembly. The peasants say that they are tired of waiting.

@reform

How should the party go about it? Cautiously, with compromises, it will cost a resource, do less and anger less. In full, it will do all that it says, and its opponents will answer. And a party strong enough can carry it out and break its opponents.

- @reform_slow: Go about it cautiously, with compromises.
- @reform_decree: Carry it out in full.
- @reform_force: Carry it out in full, and break any opposition by force.

@reform_slow
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Milder effects and little anger. Costs 1 resource.
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to pay the compensation with.
on-arrival: {!

RO.law(Q, 'slow', () => {
RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: -4, rel_kad: -2, rel_ally: 1});
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 1});
Q.land_committees = (Q.land_committees || 0) + 1;
}, "Move state and Church lands to the committees at once");
!}

State, appanage and Church lands were put at the committees' disposal. The private estates are still untouched. It is a gesture, and the peasants know it. (It was done cautiously, with compromises.)



